        "TileImage": "$($repository 42d6d05e-356f-4e36-92ed-f9817b59497d).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47.\r\rLjudmila Vetrova prides herself in her ability to be the most influential person on Haven Island. However, someone else has been catching people&apos;s attention with her swimsuit made of solid gold.\r\rEliminate Hilde Sorbetto, along with her fiance, to send a message to the rest of the islanders. And 47, make it bloody. Vetrova doesn&apos;t want any trace left of Sorbetto&apos;s body, so make sure it gets completely pulverized.\r\rDo not eliminate any staff members either.\r\rHappy hunting 47!",
